{"version":1,"content":"<p>首部取得公映許可的全人工智慧（AI）電影「三星堆：未來往事」23日正式登上院線。</p><p>該片從製作歷時2年，期間AI軟體不斷換代，團隊曾多次重新製作畫面。</p><p>據報導，AI製作最大優勢是成本降低。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.192986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:05.506322+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798271+00:00","content_hash":"a9614634bb4c0c5705b822937fd3f326fbf2fe1ce164298203b4ff6132a1b466","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}